silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_06_biological_analogy_concrete_anchor_2#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Biological Analogy --- Taxonomy and Evolution' the bare symbol LifecycleEvent anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
